OL,3,A#10m business park in 'apocalyptic'
OL,4,Astate after caravan and tonnes of waste
OL,5,Adumped
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn empty multi-million pound business
OL,8,Fpark looks like "an apocalypse" after
OL,9,Ftonnes of rubbish and a caravan was
OL,10,Fdumped on the site by people living
OL,11,Fthere.
OL,13,FBrocastle Business Park in Bridgend was
OL,14,Fbuilt in 2021 with #10m from the Welsh
OL,15,Fgovernment, but locals said about 100
OL,16,Fpeople living in 40 caravans were there
OL,17,Ffor several months.
OL,19,FThe park, which has sat empty for five
OL,20,Fyears, has rubble, garden waste, black
OL,21,Fbags and an old caravan strewn across
OL,22,Fthe vast site.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
